OL,3,GNEWSACambridgeshire's Make a Difference
OL,4,Awinners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old boy who saved his mum
OL,7,Fand brother after a car crash was one
OL,8,Fof eight community heroes honoured at
OL,9,FBBC Radio Cambridgeshire's Make a
OL,10,FDifference Awards 2026.
OL,12,FHugo was handed the Young Hero Award at
OL,13,Fthe ceremony held at The Maltings in
OL,14,FEly on Tuesday evening.
OL,16,FHere are all of this year's winners.
OL,18,FIn May 2024, Hugo, his mother and
OL,19,Fbrother, were travelling in a car which
OL,20,Fwas involved in a collision.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
